member.remarks:
The matching order mirrors .
On .NET 9 and later, span alternate lookup avoids allocating candidate keys;
the .NET Standard 2.0 path retains string-key lookup compatibility.

example.code:
var cc = new Opencc();
var normalized = cc.NormalizeCompat("金庸小說");
var converted = cc.Convert(normalized);
var displayText = cc.DeTofu(converted, DeTofuLevel.ExtB);

var normalized = Opencc.NormalizeUnicodeCompat("⾣︰﹐");
var cc = new Opencc();
var converted = cc.Convert(normalized);

var cc = new Opencc();
var normalized = cc.NormalizeCompatExtended("天龍八部書裡‧︰");
var converted = cc.Convert(normalized);
var displayText = cc.DeTofu(converted, DeTofuLevel.ExtB);

